@startuml
' 交互性图：管理员发起结算的端到端交互
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 190
skinparam ParticipantPadding 14
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title UML时序图：管理员发起账本结算

autonumber
actor "管理员" as Admin
participant "客户端" as Client
participant "API 网关" as Api
participant "权限策略\nPermissionPolicy" as Permission
participant "结算服务\nSettlementService" as Settlement
participant "账目仓储\nEntryRepository" as EntryRepo
participant "结算匹配器\nSettlementMatcher" as Matcher
participant "报告仓储\nReportRepository" as ReportRepo
participant "审计服务\nAuditService" as Audit
participant "数据库" as Database

Admin -> Client : 发起当前账本结算
Client -> Api : POST /ledgers/{ledgerId}/settlements + Idempotency-Key
Api -> Permission : checkCanSettle(userId, ledgerId)
Permission --> Api : 允许
Api -> Settlement : generateReport(commandId, ledgerId, operatorId)

Settlement -> EntryRepo : findUnsettledEntries(ledgerId)
EntryRepo --> Settlement : 账目 + 付款快照 + 分摊明细
note right of Settlement
  首版为全账本结算，不支持部分选择；
  同一 Idempotency-Key 返回同一报告。
end note

note right of Settlement
  分摊成员和策略已在账目提交时冻结，
  结算只读取已确认的付款与分摊快照。
end note

Settlement -> Matcher : buildNetAndMatch(entries, payments, splitShares)
Matcher --> Settlement : netCents[] + transfers[]
note right of Matcher
  分摊方案已按整数分冻结；
  债务人与债权人按金额双指针匹配。
end note

Settlement -> ReportRepo : save(report, settlementLines, transfers)
Settlement -> EntryRepo : markSettled(entryIds)
Settlement -> Audit : recordSettlement(ledgerId, operatorId, result)
Audit -> Database : insert audit log
Settlement -> Database : COMMIT 事务
note right of Database
  报告、付款指令、结清状态和
  审计日志在同一事务中提交。
end note

Settlement --> Api : SettlementReportDTO
Api --> Client : HTTP 200 + 报告
Client --> Admin : 展示成员应得/应付金额
note over Settlement, Client
  系统只生成结算报告，不发起真实转账；
  实际付款由成员线下协商。
end note

@enduml
